  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.2.1:\n\nBreaking changes:\n- TryGetFirstValue moved from List<T> in Tellurian.Utilities to IEnumerable<T> in Tellurian.Utilities.Linq\n- StringExtensions: AnyOf renamed to IsAnyOf, AnyPartOf renamed to IsAnyPartOf\n\nNew features:\n- NumberExtensions: int.IsAlsoOddOrEven(int) for parity checking\n- LinqExtensions: IndexOf(Func<T, bool>) to find index of first matching element\n- DateAndTimeExtensions: TimeSpan.Max(TimeSpan) and TimeSpan.Min(TimeSpan)\n- StringExtensions: Is(string?), IsNumber, IsNumberOrEmpty, IsZeroesOrEmpty, IsAllOf(char[]), OrEmpty, ToIntOrZero, ToDoubleOrZero, AsArray(), FirstItem(string), AreAllEmpty (on IEnumerable<string>), HasFileExtension(params string[])\n- DataSetExtensions: DataRow.GetRowFields(), DataRow.IsBlankRow(), DataRow.BackgroundColor(int?)\n- ObjectExtensions: AsArray(), AsEnumerable()\n- ColorExtensions: IsNotWhiteColor, expanded named color support to 70+ colors\n- MarkupStringExtensions: Span(string) and Div(string) HTML helpers",
